{"3676100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Life 2047 Escape Simulator", "steam_appid": 3676100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life 2047: Escape Simulator</strong> is an atmospheric game with elements of arcade and stealth, set in a cyberpunk dystopia. Here, every step forward is a struggle against a system that watches, punishes, and repeats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning — the same room. The same line. The same faces. You move forward, but it feels like you're standing still. What is this? A simulation? A punishment? Or part of someone’s plan?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE AS CORE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance, earn points, and use them to get closer to the exit. Every step costs resources. Every hesitation might cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/1171499de08c1ca6a2067b28b325cb8f.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINI-GAMES THAT OFFER A CHANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack the system, solve puzzles, pass reaction-based challenges — each success may break the loop… or trigger retaliation. Follow instructions or disrupt the order? Obey or resist? <br>Every choice affects the world and brings you closer to one of several endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/6e2c5c9370d8ba041e75ec1809f17813.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVEILLANCE AND CONTROL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cameras, drones, enforcer bots — the system sees everything. Any deviation from the pattern is dangerous. Stay unnoticed if you want to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/b893ce5edb68e86ead7ace3b7f945e1e.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD OF SOVIET CYBERPUNK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Panel buildings, endless bureaucratic corridors, flickering terminals, and public announcements echoing from the past. Only this past now belongs to machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/9796ad40b98c8ace6a3fd9579cd8732e.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A STORY FILLED WITH SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system leaves traces — codes, encrypted messages, interface glitches, fragments of dialogue. All of it part of a larger puzzle that only you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the first to be trapped in this world. But maybe — just maybe — you'll be the last.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life 2047: Escape Simulator</strong> is an atmospheric game with elements of arcade and stealth, set in a cyberpunk dystopia. Here, every step forward is a struggle against a system that watches, punishes, and repeats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every morning — the same room. The same line. The same faces. You move forward, but it feels like you're standing still. What is this? A simulation? A punishment? Or part of someone’s plan?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE LINE AS CORE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance, ea