static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.poster.avif?t=1780414054\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.webm?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/extras/54f11772272b962291e8e3a5b5fa63fa.mp4?t=1780414054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not the first to be trapped in this world. But maybe — just maybe — you'll be the last.</p>", "short_description": "Life 2047: Escape Simulator is an atmospheric puzzle game set in a cyberpunk dystopia. The line is your path to freedom. Hack the system, evade surveillance, uncover hidden truths, and escape the loop where every day repeats. Are you a glitch — or salvation?", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/98c8bacc79e42eb4565c1d1ca6d42280881fde42/header.jpg?t=1780414054", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/0d11ff1f9f0b0fbf370c9768587bdff683ac782d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780414054", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676100/0d11ff1f9f0b0fbf370c9768587bdff683ac782d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780414054", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>Storag